  "title": "Easy Pork Chops with Cream of Mushroom Soup",
  "description": "You'll be reminded of your youth with this pork chop recipe that uses convenient ingredients like cream of mushroom soup and french-fried onions.",
  "authors": [
    "Becky Lemcke Thompson"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-06-30T12:38:45-04:00",
